rovider\",\n        \"Use a single sign-on provider for both patients and staff\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"topic\": \"compliance\",\n      \"text\": \"Which healthcare privacy or regulatory requirements apply to the patient data?\",\n      \"suggestions\": [\n        \"HIPAA applies\",\n        \"GDPR applies\",\n        \"Both HIPAA and GDPR apply\",\n        \"No specific regulatory requirements are known\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"topic\": \"integrations\",\n      \"text\": \"Must the app integrate with any existing clinic scheduling, practice-management, or patient-record systems?\",\n      \"suggestions\": [\n        \"No existing-system integrations\",\n        \"Read availability from an existing scheduling system\",\n        \"Synchronize bookings and cancellations with an existing system\",\n        \"Integrate with a specified system or API\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}

